{"server":"en","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-04_beg","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-04","title":"Festering Scars","storyCode":"6-4","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"363eae5fa9713c4ab3518d47d3fd0b76c98767c958fb85e6a336ad5d90100ae4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hurry! Get back! The Infected have turned into monsters!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Agh! I've been bit! I've been bit!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Herd","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ung."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Herd","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Aaaahh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Herd","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"(Terrifying screaming)."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"How could this happen...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"What has that nasty little boy done?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor, we need to move! We have to meet up with Amiya!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"A small fire team can't handle a herd of this size. We have to tread carefully!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"There's nothing we can do for the L. G. D. now. We're in a much worse position than them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Set them aside. My top priority is to guarantee your safety."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcity_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"We're being overrun!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"We're dead if we don't retreat!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Don't panic."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?! Who's...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"That uniform... You're..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"The cavalry is here. Stand firm."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"Form two teams and move on their flanks."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"But, Master..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"Trust me. While I cannot take action myself, this method will succeed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"Execute a pincer attack, hold the enemy in place, and leave the stragglers to your reinforcements."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Herd","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Nnng... Ngaaaa!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"...Thank you, sir!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"If you hadn't come to help..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"Behind you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"C- counterattack!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"It is no use."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"Form up. And fall back."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, sir!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"No, if we do that..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"We can't hold here. We have to find a way out..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course! The high ground! We move up the stairs and attack down into the corridor!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"...No. All we can do is hold. But at least we won't get cornered by this crowd of lunatics!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Right. Come about, gather up at each doorway, pull back the teams, and take a defensive formation! Hurry! Move!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"Well done. I approve."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Sir, come with us!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"No need."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"What?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"Go."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"I will move on the ground."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcity_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"We can't hold them!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"All we have is piercing weapons, and they're useless against these things!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hold your ground!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"We're the last line of defense for the civilians behind us!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Then what do we do?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"We fight to the last man!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Watch the Originium they're throwing. It corrodes your equipment, and some of them explode!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah...! They hit Ah Chung!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ah Chung, get back! You, move up! Don't let them through!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Herd","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Guuhhh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Aaaaaagh! Th- they got me! They're eating me! Noo! Aaaaieeeee!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ah Yee!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"How embarrassing!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Zongguan Bailei Zhengfa, loose!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Herd","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Nnng...!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Lightning Arts?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"H- how... you wiped them all out in one bright flash?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*Pant...* *pant...*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I just said I would not act. Little did I know how incapable you are of protecting the masses."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"That I would be forced to take such action, it's humiliating!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Censor..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam nothing! Were you not told to ignore my presence?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"...We never thought..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I found your spirit laudable. How disappointing it was to see you hopping about aimlessly, leaving me to do your work. Honestly, what were you doing?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Now! To your place!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"But you just said..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Chop chop! How have you not learned to move with haste even after witnessing me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, but of course. You did not witness me. I did nothing. Is that clear?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Crystal!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But if a single hair on the head of a single commoner comes to harm, you are all terminated. Even I must resign. We are all unemployed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Y- yes, of course... We'll fight with all our strength."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Very good. Now why are you just standing there? Move!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"By the way...? Do you know those Black Cloaks?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Black Cloak? What's that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Censor","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Get your eyes checked! Those people on the rooftops, wearing the billowing black cloaks."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Captain","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Apologies, Madam. What are you talking about?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcity_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swire","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"Defenders, fan out!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Recon team, fall back! Hold firing position!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Are these Infected mutants messing with the radio waves? Our scouts could be in trouble."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swire","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"We can't hold them...! There's so many! Didn't you cut through a whole wave of these things back there? Why haven't you done that already?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"This is different!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swire","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"Hah. Leave it to this puk gaai Lung to be so useless right when we need her most!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Then why don't you show us what you can do!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swire","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"Drone!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swire","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"SUPERINTENDENT CH'EN SAYS: RECON TEAM! FALL BACK! HOLD FIRING POSITION!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swire","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"How was that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swire","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"I said how was that?! Fire team, loose explosive bolts!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"What did you say?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swire","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Am I deaf now thanks to you?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Go. Use your talents to get the word out to the communications team at Originium Transciever Beta. Have them tell everyone: the herd is tough, hold your positions, minimize casualties, don't conserve firepower."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swire","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"You really are a *Lungmen profanity*!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"I can read your lips!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swire","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"(Mouthing the word 'diu')."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Sir!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't hear you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"SIR!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Herd","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"(Din of roaring)."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Speak up!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"SIR!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Defender","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Use the bunker-busters! Hurry!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"It's quiet."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Sir."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Okay. I can hear you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Go ahead. Speak."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"We have... guests."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Already? They took the chance to infiltrate our unit, huh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"I guess it's to be expected. They were never going to give us free rein."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Anyway, it doesn't change our plans. Let them see how strong Lungmen is."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"One more thing. I... I'm not sure how accurate the reports are."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Out with it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Some units have reported sightings of individuals wearing black raincoats."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Thankfully no. We've seen evidence of them clashing with Reunion. And..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"And what?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L. G. D. Officer","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"And... the Reunion they clashed with all seem to have died in, how can I describe it...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Sounds like an urban legend. You've got shadowy figures running around Lungmen in black raincoats on a bright, sunny day? Somebody needs help..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Black raincoats?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"What is... that?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"Sector 12 cleansed. Purged of Infected."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"Teams 3 and 4 operating."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"Moving to next sector."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Herd","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Guh... Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Herd","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"(Strange crying)."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"W- why! Why are you hurting your people? Snap out of it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"N- no! Run! Hurry!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Get out of here! Don't let them get you! Run!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"Additional target acquired."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"Infected fugitive group on the border of Sectors 13 and 6. 44 individuals."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"Completion estimate: within five minutes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"Operation commencing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Agh! H- help!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"We surrender! We——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"GreyThroat","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"Um... N- no..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["Ch'en"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["L. G. D. Captain","L. G. D. Officer"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["Blaze"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["Swire"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["GreyThroat"]}]}
